{"entries":[{"applicable_observations":"SSH 认证与连接可提供资产级访问候选；缺 socket 不建立进程归属。","detection_strategies":[{"external_id":"DET0596","object_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--5367273a-2f30-413e-a961-1dbd323be5b0","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0596"}],"modified":"2025-10-24T17:48:34.985Z","name":"SSH","normal_alternative":"合法远程管理也会产生 SSH 访问；候选不证明成功横向移动。","object_id":"attack-pattern--2db31dcd-54da-405d-acef-b9129b816ed6","object_version":"1.3","platforms":["ESXi","Linux","macOS"],"rule_id":"R04","source_object_sha256":"e1ba7d1fea038380d79f7008637ec2f640d961669f60be6f636c0f7cd4a6e726","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1021/004","technique_id":"T1021.004"},{"applicable_observations":"基于预先冻结正常上下文的出站流量偏离可提示调查方向。","detection_strategies":[{"external_id":"DET0348","object_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--beb3a98c-f1a4-434a-81e7-29d178b14db2","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0348"}],"modified":"2025-10-24T17:49:06.675Z","name":"Exfiltration Over C2 Channel","normal_alternative":"备份、同步、更新也可能产生大流量；异常量不证明数据窃取。","object_id":"attack-pattern--92d7da27-2d91-488e-a00c-059dc162766d","object_version":"2.3","platforms":["ESXi","Linux","macOS","Windows"],"rule_id":"R06","source_object_sha256":"c1225137fa8051613210ac7e3f0ea8ca8863e7991d6aa627738da8d78d2c341c","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1041","technique_id":"T1041"},{"applicable_observations":"同源短窗多目标或多端口连接，可辅助定位扫描候选。","detection_strategies":[{"external_id":"DET0376","object_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--82e20b1f-300e-43cc-9259-1d506ef5d1f8","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0376"}],"modified":"2025-10-24T17:49:31.494Z","name":"Network Service Discovery","normal_alternative":"资产巡检、可用性检测也可能产生相似连接。","object_id":"attack-pattern--e3a12395-188d-4051-9a16-ea8e14d07b88","object_version":"3.2","platforms":["Containers","IaaS","Linux","macOS","Network Devices","Windows"],"rule_id":"R01","source_object_sha256":"b224e6b286a05c4312621fa66122aac205c73de685517d8f7b1a585cac558175","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1046","technique_id":"T1046"},{"applicable_observations":"Unix shell 执行记录须结合可靠进程身份、父子关系与原始片段。","detection_strategies":[{"external_id":"DET0384","object_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--4a89bf52-7be1-405d-8d02-462e52553bc5","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0384"}],"modified":"2025-10-24T17:49:12.476Z","name":"Unix Shell","normal_alternative":"授权运维和自动化脚本也会调用 shell。","object_id":"attack-pattern--a9d4b653-6915-42af-98b2-5758c4ceee56","object_version":"1.4","platforms":["ESXi","Linux","macOS","Network Devices"],"rule_id":"R03","source_object_sha256":"db16f4bec6dcc1e9b93fc5352791287d4a5535c74f8163a1f43a598f94779c6b","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1059/004","technique_id":"T1059.004"},{"applicable_observations":"周期性连接只提供应用层通信候选，需要协议与其他证据补证。","detection_strategies":[{"external_id":"DET0444","object_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--155cab5b-c70b-4cfb-ba52-f62a21836b19","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0444"}],"modified":"2025-10-24T17:48:38.368Z","name":"Application Layer Protocol","normal_alternative":"监控心跳、健康检查同样周期通信；周期本身不证明 C2。","object_id":"attack-pattern--355be19c-ffc9-46d5-8d50-d6a036c675b6","object_version":"2.4","platforms":["Linux","macOS","Windows","Network Devices","ESXi"],"rule_id":"R05","source_object_sha256":"d792a480df2769a2baf1215df87050b3c78a99e2c5f92d719731c82b384b9973","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1071","technique_id":"T1071"},{"applicable_observations":"同账号或来源的重复认证失败及后续结果，需保留主机与时间范围。","detection_strategies":[{"external_id":"DET0463","object_id":"x-mitre-detection-strategy--1439efe8-4d10-4ce8-8727-458db69bae85","url":"https://attack.mitre.org/detectionstrategies/DET0463"}],"modified":"2025-10-24T17:49:12.218Z","name":"Brute Force","normal_alternative":"密码过期、服务配置错误或用户误输也可造成失败。","object_id":"attack-pattern--a93494bb-4b80-4ea1-8695-3236a49916fd","object_version":"2.8","platforms":["Containers","ESXi","IaaS","Identity Provider","Linux","macOS","Network Devices","Office Suite","SaaS","Windows"],"rule_id":"R02","source_object_sha256":"b7ab3ebd3c54887f488ed8a45a32874f775621e7e9886ed04773dbe23abc8c04","source_url":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1110","technique_id":"T1110"}],"knowledge_version":"attack-18.1-curated@1.0.0"}